  "body": "<figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/c05442dc1b107a21241cd4c0521838ce1_65984831_210126_0005-3.jpg\"></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/c05442dc1b107a21241cd4c0521838ce1_65984831_210126_0030-3.jpg\"></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/c05442dc1b107a21241cd4c0521838ce1_65984831_210126_0062-3.jpg\"></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/c05442dc1b107a21241cd4c0521838ce1_74500125_220217_0.jpg\"></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/s__3719468.jpg\"></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/c60f9578fa906ee6535f7c66ab1d83053_4941395673120225393_231106_19.jpg\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>結合不同型態老屋：蕃社30三合院（陳家古厝）、蕃社20土埆厝（House 好事）、蕃社40-1紅磚平房（烘焙小屋），將中港地區蕃社在地文化以徒步方式介紹給來參訪的民眾，以實地的建築觀察與建材討論，搭配古厝主人家故事，勾勒出八十年來本地的常民文化足跡。本館開放團體預約導覽以及教育單位地方文化課程合作，歡迎至陳家古厝洽詢。</p>\n\n\n\n<p>歡迎來電 <a href=\"tel:0953118143\">0953118143</a> 預約團體導覽服務\\教學合作 行程與手作體驗介紹</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><img src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/e5b08fe69785e8a18ce7b6b2e9a081e789882024.jpg?w=1024\" alt=\"\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>在舊城的寧靜巷弄裡，漫步舊城事，六大主題文化之旅</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><img src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/e89ea2e5b995e5bfabe785a7-2026-06-26-e4b88ae58d8810.27.11.png?w=750\" alt=\"\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>點選下圖查閱行程內容，每月不定期開團（5人以上可揪團預約行程）</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>中文、英文、台語、客語，皆可安排專人不同語言導覽解說</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/e68a95e5bdb1e789873.jpeg\"></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/e68a95e5bdb1e789874.jpeg\"></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/e68a95e5bdb1e789875.jpeg\"></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/e68a95e5bdb1e789876.jpeg\"></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/e68a95e5bdb1e789877.jpeg\"></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/e68a95e5bdb1e789878.jpeg\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>來趟文化小旅，為生活加入一點手作溫度吧！</p>\n\n\n\n<p>地方職人手作課程讓小旅行更豐盛（5人以上可預約手作課程）</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/e68a95e5bdb1e789875.jpeg\"></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/e68a95e5bdb1e789877.jpeg\"></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/e68a95e5bdb1e789878.jpeg\"></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/e89ea2e5b995e5bfabe785a7-2023-12-01-e4b88be58d882.35.13.png\"></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/e89ea2e5b995e5bfabe785a7-2023-12-29-e4b88be58d883.26.20.png\"></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/e89ea2e5b995e5bfabe785a7-2023-12-29-e4b88be58d883.26.49.png\"></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/e68a95e5bdb1e7898710.jpeg\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>走路，是認識一個地方最舒適的方法來一起漫步番社吧！</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><img src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/white-modern-travel-poster-1.png?w=724\" alt=\"\"></figure>",
