  "summary": "蕃社原創 文創商品展售 老屋建築有需多文化元素，例如：花磚、紅磚牆、屋瓦、斗拱…..等。我們運用這些元素，延續老屋美學工…",
  "cover": "https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/p_20200308_120911_bok_0-1.jpg",
  "body": "<h4>蕃社原創 <strong>文創商品展售</strong></h4>\n\n\n\n<p>老屋建築有需多文化元素，例如：花磚、紅磚牆、屋瓦、斗拱…..等。我們運用這些元素，延續老屋美學工藝，設計出文化產品。</p>\n\n\n\n<h4><a href=\"https://www.huansiaeshop.com/\">蕃社好市集 線上商城</a></h4>\n\n\n\n<p>「蕃社好市集」嚴選在地優良農產及店家商品，以「蕃社30陳家古厝」為銷售據點，透過網路行銷宣傳商品，提供本地居民最貼近在地的優質選物據點。</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/p_20200308_120911_bok_0-1.jpg\"></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/p_20200308_120501_1_bok_5-1.jpg\"></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/e88ab1e7a39ae69dafe5a28a.jpg\"></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/p_20200308_120542_bok_3-1.jpg\"></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/p_20200308_120607_1_bok_1-1.jpg\"></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/e5b1b1e6b5b7e99b86e789b9e588a5e58c85e8a39de9bab5e88cb63-fbe59c96e6a899e7b1a4.jpg\"></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/c90f86e8de175ea5578ca757630a3c4c3_4620693218539377110_200814_1-1.jpg\"></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/p_20200308_121113_1_bok_4-1.jpg\"></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/c90f86e8de175ea5578ca757630a3c4c3_4620693218539377110_200814-1.jpg\"></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/p_20201123_101932.jpg\"></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/c90f86e8de175ea5578ca757630a3c4c3_4620693218539377110_200814_0-1.jpg\"></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://house30home.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/p_20200308_120733_1_bok_2-1.jpg\"